  "modification_guides": [
    {
      "question": "main.py如何启动、运行主循环、切换战斗和退出？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "Start->StartStep1调用OnGameStart；Loop初始MainLoop。MainLoop驱动网络/HTTP/模块回调；WarLoop在非暂停时war.Process(True)，然后MainLoop。SetWarLoop/SetMainLoop改Loop；Restart暂置AfterRestart。退出与重登录见CloseGame/ExitGame/RealExit/doexit/doreturn，不能混淆Quit设置时点。快捷键见下一问。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "start",
          "mainloop",
          "net_multi",
          "warloop",
          "restart",
          "close",
          "exit",
          "doreturn"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "公告失败在哪触发，正文/地址/布局分别改哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "公告逻辑在entry337：refreshbulletin在succeed为假或响应缺少\\r\\n\\r\\n时显示“刷新公告失敗”。这不是refreshService的错误提示；实际失败原因未知，未请求业务URL。 正文news.txt由refreshbulletin成功响应body覆盖；写文件异常时才把body.split缓存g_News，并非HTTP失败时缓存。OnMessage(30)按g_LangVersion==0读取update.ini的Setting/News及Service，否则HK节；布局login/mainpage.dlg。Show的候选else内创建面板，并在autoupdate与时间条件满足时调度OnMessage(30)；该else位置异常待原生复核，不宣称自动刷新已可用。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "mp_cls",
          "mp_news_url",
          "mp_refresh",
          "mp_show"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "登录按钮点击后经过哪些函数和模块？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "CLoginIn.OnMessage(2)仅在not misc.IsTWServer()内检查chk_agree；对象存在且未选中才提示并return。其余情况调用LoginOk：非空/密码长度/账号非纯数字校验后C2SLoginIn，再设置错误回调。OnLogin是另一个入口，LoginIn存在才SaveAccount；不能由此证明提交即成功或直接调用OnLogin。RandomConnect在OneoffLogin/OneoffLogin2内，不串入普通按钮链。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "li_message2",
          "li_loginok",
          "li_onlogin",
          "li_autologin"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "注册逻辑与布局分别在哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "首页OnMessage(2)在IsTWServer()真时打开外部REGISTER_URL（按g_LangVersion分支）；仅非TW才隐藏首页并register.Show(True)->Step(0)。register各CRegPanel与回调负责逻辑，布局reg1/reg2/reg3/reg4/reg5.dlg，CConfirm另用login/confirm.dlg。confirm是独立确认入口，不能当成Step序列；未验证布局资源内容或注册服务可用。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
        "evidence": [
          "mp_entry",
          "rg_confirm",
          "rg_reg1",
          "rg_reg2",
          "rg_reg2_2980",
          "rg_panels34",
          "rg_stepshow"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "question": "快捷键清理、默认键与战斗切换分别在哪里？",
      "answer": {
        "text": "ClearHotKey只处理其列出的键；RegisterDefaultHotKey注册关闭/Esc/Enter与截图，RegisterChatHotKey注册聊天键；SwitchHotKey受g_DisableHotKey守卫，按IsWar选择战斗/非战斗键。默认Enter委托interface.DefaultButtonClick，实际焦点与原生事件未验。",
        "confidence": "static_reviewed",
